@startuml SEQ_18_MELIHAT_RUBRIK_PENILAIAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-18: Melihat Rubrik Penilaian

actor       "Admin / Asisten / Dosen / Kadep"  as User
boundary    "Browser"                          as Browser
control     "KomponenRubrikController"         as Controller
entity      "KomponenRubrik Model"             as Model

== Lihat Daftar Komponen Rubrik ==

User    ->  Browser    : Buka halaman tugas, tab "Rubrik Penilaian"
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/tugas/{id}/rubrik
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model    : Query komponen rubrik berdasarkan tugas
Model --> Controller   : Data komponen
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman daftar komponen
Browser    --> User    : Tampilkan komponen rubrik\n(view-only)

== Lihat Nilai Tambahan ==

User    ->  Browser    : Buka tab "Nilai Tambahan" pada tugas
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/tugas/{id}/nilai-tambahan
Controller --> Browser : Render tabel nilai tambahan
Browser    --> User    : Tampilkan tabel nilai tambahan per praktikan

@enduml